prime-agent-core

General-purpose agent with transport abstraction, state management,
and attachment support. Includes LLM provider integration (delegating
to @earendil-works/pi-ai), conversation state persistence, and
attachment handling for the Prime Agent ecosystem.

This is a sub-package of the Prime Agent monorepo, distributed as
a pre-built npm package. The dist/ directory contains compiled
TypeScript output (JavaScript + type declarations).
